                "text": "Parkland Health Center in Bonne Terre is making a real difference for patients and the overall health of the local community. It was the first health center in the state to receive a Rural Emergency Hospital (REH) designation, which Congress created in 2021 to help preserve access to care in rural areas. As Ways and Means Chairman, ending the rural health crisis has been, and will continue to be, a top priority.",
